  '**For whoever reads this in two years.** _The old thread was closed on 1 March 2024 by Raed and Anas, because the same eleven questions were being answered in two places._',
  '**What is left out of each.** The first leaves out **the reason** and both names. The second leaves out **the instruction** — an editor does not post. ⚠ **The third leaves out everything anybody has to do.**',
