  '**Write it on the rejection slip and not on the delivery note.** ⚠ The delivery note stays with us and nobody reads it again — **the slip is the copy that goes back, and it is the only one the depot sees.** That is the whole reason and it is the only reason on this page.',
  '**If none of the three codes fits, write _OT_ and one line on the back.** A code with a line on the back is worth having. ⚠ **A code that nearly fits is worse than nothing**, because the depot will act on it and the real cause will never be found.',
