out.push(S('Board clinic – typical mistakes'));
out.push(A('**✗** _It is badly written._ → **✓** name the reader it was written for.   **✗** Rewriting somebody else\'s notice. → **✓** six words: _what do I do, and when?_   **✗** The history in the first paragraph. → **✓** the record paragraph, with dates.   **✗** Naming the reader as an accusation. → **✓** flat, and without comment.   **✗** Counting other people\'s pages first. → **✓** your own.'));
out.push(S('Stage 5 · Read'));
out.push(A('**1** **Eleven pages, two imperatives, four dates** — and he will not be making the complaint about the directorate\'s notices **again in the same words.**'));
