out.push(S('Board clinic – typical mistakes'));
out.push(A('**✗** _Background._ → **✓** a heading that names its reader.   **✗** A two-sentence summary. → **✓** one sentence, what and when.   **✗** The record layer shortest. → **✓** longest; it carries what nobody will remember.   **✗** An approval inside an instruction. → **✓** separate layers.   **✗** A layer that cannot be read alone. → **✓** stop at each and ask.'));
